@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN
@conversationId = YOUR_CONVERSATION_ID
@messageId = YOUR_MESSAGE_ID

# Auth: cookie OR Bearer - server checks Cookie first, then Bearer
# Use either: Cookie: token={{token}} OR Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Send Message - Logged User (optionalAuth - cookie OR Bearer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token={{token}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "conversationId": "{{conversationId}}",
  "content": "What is the meaning of Ayat Al-Kursi?"
}

### Send Message - New Conversation (optionalAuth - cookie OR Bearer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token={{token}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "content": "Hello, start new chat"
}

### Send Message - Guest (no token, uses guestKey cookie)
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "What is Islam?",
  "chat_history": []
}

### Delete Message (cookie OR Bearer)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/messages/{{messageId}}
Cookie: token={{token}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
